      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3.5625 → 3.5625</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>支持与覆盖率下降，分数保持不变。</Text>
